      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAID IN GLORY (4) settled well off the leaders but kept coming to finish third over 520m at this track in 30.48 last time. Likely to enjoy the staying trip for the first time. Capable of going well again. HAPPY SHIRTS (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (30.44) in a Grade 5 at this track. The form out of his last race has been franked. Expected to feature in the finish. HIGH COURT JUDGE (3) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 5 lengths at Q Lakeside (30.87). Comes through a solid form race last start. Should be in this for a long way. BLACKJACK TABLE (2) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
